        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="14" paddingRight="14" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">定时器是硬件在替我们数数，CPU 只在到点那一刻出手一次。</span></p>
        </content>
